    "updated_at": "2016-02-29T23:21:54Z",
    "body": "Added a proxy test case. Firefox and Edge again throw a DataCloneError, and this time Chrome outputs an empty object, ignoring the own property. The spec currently requires the DataCloneError per:\n\n> Otherwise, if input is an exotic object, then throw a DataCloneError exception.\n",
