    "created_at": "2016-03-01T06:38:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-01T06:38:59Z",
    "body": "Should we keep [[Transfer]] inconsistent and only exposed on objects annotated as transferable objects? (This is why I initially wanted to give all objects these internal methods. Implications would be more obvious and new objects would automatically throw unless specified otherwise.)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
