    "created_at": "2016-03-01T15:51:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-01T15:51:28Z",
    "body": "I would probably literally say \"Otherwise, if _input_ has any internal slots, then throw a DataCloneError exception.\" You could then remove step 17 for [[ErrorData]]. I guess this would go after the current step 19.\n",
